====Lantern harpooning====
{{Main|Lantern harpooning}}
A lit lantern and a harpoon are required to fish at specific [[Fishing_spot_(lantern)|lantern harpooning fishing spots]], only accessible with the [[Sailing]] skill, to catch [[raw swordtip squid|swordtip squid]] and [[raw jumbo squid|jumbo squid]]. A minimum Sailing level of {{SCP|Sailing|47}} is required, enabling access to the spots at [[The Onyx Crest]].

Of the available lanterns, the [[bug lantern]] and [[abyssal lantern]] may be preferable, as they can be wielded to save an inventory space.

In addition to being able to be cooked for food or cut for offcuts like most fish, raw squid may also be [[pestle and mortar|crushed]] for [[squid paste]], and cutting raw squid can rarely produce a [[squid beak]] in addition to the offcuts.

